{% comment %}
  Brand landing page (AICO storefront — Shopify-nonstandard `/brand/<handle>`).

  BR1: brand pages are AICO Neo content-builder landing pages authored in
  aiconeo. The backend resolves (shop, brand) → the brand's authored landing
  page and binds it as the `page` drop with server-hydrated Neo data
  (storefront-typed elements carry `content.aico_hydrated`; see
  assets/storefront-neo-blocks.js for the renderers). An unauthored brand
  page, an unknown handle, or a brand outside the customer's entitlement
  404s server-side — so this template has no placeholder/skeleton branches.

  Rendering is client-side via the same Neo mount the content pages use:
  snippets/neo-content.liquid emits #aico-content + the inline
  #aico-page-data JSON; assets/content-builder-neo.js (window.NewsNeo)
  paints the sections, and assets/storefront-neo-blocks.js registers the
  brand/product element renderers on top.

  This replaces the retired `aico_brand_campaigns` theme-settings path
  (hero/gender/products/news were server-rendered from per-brand settings).
{% endcomment %}

<main class="aico-brand-page aico-neo-brand-page" role="main" aria-label="{{ 'brand_page.aria_main' | t }}">
  {% render 'neo-content', page: page %}
</main>
